{"id":"4c0e8087df7fe695","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-elementary-substructure.md","title":"Elementary Substructures for an Abstract Logic","display":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructures for an Abstract Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-elementary-substructure","aliases":["67-df-elementary-substructure"],"display":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructures for an Abstract Logic","depends_on":["[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","[[67-df-abstract-logic]]","[[67-df-isomorphism]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-elementary-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-elementary-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructures for an Abstract Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa449de50b1c012\" href=\"?note=2aa449de50b1c012\" title=\"67-df-isomorphism\">67-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a> 的候选逻辑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_\\sigma\">\\(\\subseteq_\\sigma\\)</span> 和新常元扩张取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa449de50b1c012\" href=\"?note=2aa449de50b1c012\" title=\"67-df-isomorphism\">67-df-isomorphism</a>。</li>\n<li>固定互异符号列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(c_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((c_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cap(F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cap(F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma)=\\varnothing\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i\">\\(c_i\\)</span> 作为零元函数符号加入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_k\">\\(\\sigma_k\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a}\\)</span> 在下式递归定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in|\\mathfrak M|\">\\(b\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 是空列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\)</span> 在下式定义，签名固定时省略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma,&amp;\n\\sigma_{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_k\\oplus_F(\\{c_k\\},\\{(c_k,0)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_\\epsilon&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathfrak M,&amp;\n\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a{}^\\frown\\langle b\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a}[c_{|\\vec a|}\\mapsto b],\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a}&amp;\\in\\mathrm{Str}_{\\sigma_{|\\vec a|}},&amp;\nc_i^{\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a}}(\\epsilon)&amp;=a_i\\quad(i&lt;|\\vec a|),\\\\\n\\mathfrak B\\preceq_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\mathfrak A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_\\sigma\\mathfrak A\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\forall\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak B|^k\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left(\\mathfrak B_{\\vec a}\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma_k}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma_k}\\varphi\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma,&amp;\n\\sigma_{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_k\\oplus_F(\\{c_k\\},\\{(c_k,0)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_\\epsilon&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathfrak M,&amp;\n\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a{}^\\frown\\langle b\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a}[c_{|\\vec a|}\\mapsto b],\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a}&amp;\\in\\mathrm{Str}_{\\sigma_{|\\vec a|}},&amp;\nc_i^{\\mathfrak M_{\\vec a}}(\\epsilon)&amp;=a_i\\quad(i&lt;|\\vec a|),\\\\\n\\mathfrak B\\preceq_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\mathfrak A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_\\sigma\\mathfrak A\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\forall\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak B|^k\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left(\\mathfrak B_{\\vec a}\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma_k}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma_k}\\varphi\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条只给出后续条目实际使用的接口；所有数学条件均已列入前两节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是 [[67-df-abstract-logic]] 的候选逻辑；$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma$。$\\subseteq_\\sigma$ 和新常元扩张取 [[67-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是 [[67-df-abstract-logic]] 的候选逻辑；$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma$。$\\subseteq_\\sigma$ 和新常元扩张取 [[67-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"t